        "complete_literal_header": "private theorem fourier_norm_le_normalizedFourth_integral\n    (f : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d), ℂ)) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d)) :\n    ‖𝓕 f ξ‖ ≤ (∫ x, ‖normalizedFourth f x‖) * ((1 + ‖ξ‖ ^ 2) ^ 2)⁻¹",
