      {
        "line_1based": 227,
        "private": false,
        "complete_literal_header": "theorem CommonSmoothCutoff.smoothReciprocityLogWeight_fourier_pointwise_envelope\n    {d : ℕ} (a b c : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d))\n    (Q : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d) → ℂ)\n    (hQ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Q) (hQc : HasCompactSupport Q) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧\n      ∀ Z u₀ rho₀ R : ℝ, 1 ≤ Z → 0 ≤ R →\n        (∀ t ∈ tsupport Q, |rho₀ * Real.exp (inner ℝ b t)| ≤ R) →\n        ∀ ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d),\n          ‖𝓕 (smoothReciprocityLogWeight a b c Q Z u₀ rho₀) ξ‖ ≤\n            C * (1 + R) ^ 4 * ((1 + ‖ξ‖ ^ 2) ^ 2)⁻¹",
        "header_utf8_sha256": "bb37833f91628d67e1a3db021c5021705b4334fde5df7b0e786b2af45631b3db"
